<h1>Products</h1>

<p>Meridian Castings supplies components across four related disciplines: casting, machining, finishing and tooling. Most orders combine two or more of these, delivered as a single finished part rather than separate operations.</p>

<div class="cards">
    <article class="card">
        <h2>Castings</h2>
        <p>Sand and investment castings in iron, steel and aluminium alloys, from prototype quantities to high-volume production.</p>
        <p><a href="/products/castings">View castings</a></p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
        <h2>Machining</h2>
        <p>Three, four and five-axis CNC turning and milling to close tolerance, on cast or bar stock.</p>
        <p><a href="/products/machining">View machining</a></p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
        <h2>Finishing</h2>
        <p>Shot blasting, powder coating, zinc and passivation finishes applied in-house at Wrexham and Poznan.</p>
        <p><a href="/products/finishing">View finishing</a></p>
    </article>
    <article class="card">
        <h2>Tooling</h2>
        <p>Pattern making and tooling design carried out by our own tool room in Sheffield.</p>
        <p><a href="/products/tooling">View tooling</a></p>
    </article>
</div>

<p>All product lines operate under the same quality management system; see our <a href="/quality">quality management</a> page for details, or <a href="/contact">contact our sales team</a> to discuss a new part.</p>
